     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Started to evaluate RRO 8.0.1 on one of our RHEL servers a while back, and have started to look at the newer releases but benchamards using the <span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">R-benchmark-25.R script from h</span><a href=\"http://r.research.att.com/benchmarks/\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r.research.att.com/benchmarks/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241830244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03coXWJsV_Tb0pnqRm_9Aw\">ttp://r.research.att.com/benchmarks/</a> are not encouraging:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(31,73,125)\">RRO-3.2.0 </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\">with MKL </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">– </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\">40 threads -</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">39s</span></div><div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">RRO-8.0.3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\">with MKL</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"> – </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\">40 threads -</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">42s</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">RRO-8.0.2 with MKL–</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\">40 threads -</span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14.6666669845581px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(31,73,125);font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"> 41s</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">RRO-8.0.1 – 40 threads - 13s</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#1f497d\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6666669845581px\">Even CRAN R 3.1.3 on a single thread comes under 20s.</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">When I tweak the MKL thread count the performance improves, but performance with 40 threads does not compare with the later releases.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#1f497d\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.6666669845581px\">Has something changed?</span></font></p></div></div>"
